name: Stop a finite campaign while transport is waiting and recover honest partial work
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/campaign_stop.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/stop-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 9 job(s) | fixed-plan
nav-mode:
keys: L
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/campaign_stop.py @TMP_TARGET @ART waiting
keys: r
require-live-snap: 20 1 completed | active-work
expect: K stop
ask: Does the fixed plan show completed and active work, the frozen job list and a visible Stop control before the intercepted request is interrupted?
keys: K
keys: Escape
expect-echo-within: 250 operator draft
live-snap: stop-responsive
ask: Does Stop keep the shell responsive and preserve the operator draft while saving partial work, without claiming cancellation has already completed?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/campaign_stop.py @TMP_TARGET @ART stopped
require-live-snap: 20 no deck-launched dispatcher | settled-draft
expect: operator draft
keys: C-u
nav-mode:
keys: r
require-live-snap: 20 8 parked | partial-jobs
expect: work paused
ask: Does the stopped deck distinguish one completed job, one attempted interrupted job and seven unstarted jobs, with explicit next actions?
keys: Escape
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 RESULT partial | partial-result
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 partial acknowledged | partial-accepted
keys: Escape
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 1 unresolved | partial-report
expect: 1 / 2 attempts recorded; 1 unavailable
ask: Does the report preserve the completed observation and unresolved provider reservation, disclose missing evidence for the interrupted job and avoid complete coverage claims?
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
live-snap: narrow-report-start
keys: PgDn
live-snap: narrow-report-details
keys: End
live-snap: narrow-report
ask: Are the partial result and report actions usable in the narrow terminal with no misleading cost or completion state?
resize: 120x36
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/stop-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 8 parked | recovered-stop
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/campaign_stop.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does restart retain the stopped work, original allowance and unresolved reservation without launching more jobs or silently refunding the request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
